  "main_findings": [
    "All 12 runs (4 variants \u00d7 3 seeds) grokked: best_val_acc = 1.000 in every run; mean test_acc 0.997-0.998.",
    "Trainable layer-0 components are NOT necessary for grokking. Freezing the entire first layer (freeze_A0_M0) still yields 100% grokking.",
    "Grokking time scales monotonically with how much is frozen: tau_0.95 normal=3092, freeze_A0=3717, freeze_M0=3942, freeze_A0_M0=5850 (\u224890% slower than normal).",
    "Compression is mobile. When M0+A0 are both frozen, layer-1 MLP becomes more compressive (\u0394_MLP[1] = -2.91 vs -1.70 in normal).",
    "When ONLY A0 is frozen, M0 picks up dramatically more compression: \u0394_MLP[0] = -8.16 vs -0.93 in normal. Consistent with 'M0 cleans up raw-feature noise' interpretation.",
    "Same-sum clustering at best_val is comparable across variants (\u03c1 \u2208 [0.11, 0.23]); all variants form task-aligned representations, not arbitrary rank collapse.",
    "Memorization (first train\u22650.99) precedes geometric compression: same-sum \u03c1 is still near 1.4 at memorization moment, only drops below 0.4 once val_acc crosses 0.90.",
    "Layer-2 MLP expansion at best_val varies non-trivially across variants (+3.74 to +8.24), but every variant still groks. Final-rep eRank alone is not the marker of grokking; the transient compression-expansion at memorization may matter more."
  ],
  "recommended_next_steps": [
    "Freeze M0 *after* memorization rather than from random init (doc's flagship follow-up).",
    "Test M1 and M2 freezes for comparison \u2014 symmetric test of role flexibility.",
    "Extend to 5+ seeds; current \u03c4_0.95 ordering for freeze_A0 vs freeze_M0 is within 1 std.",
    "Post-hoc ablation of layer-0 contributions on the frozen-trained models, to test whether the random-frozen layer-0 outputs are actually load-bearing or geometric padding.",
    "Parameter-match an attention-only 3-layer model (drop M0, redistribute capacity to M1/M2) to distinguish 'M0 is replaceable' from 'M0 capacity is required'.",
    "Replicate the freeze_A0 \u2192 \u0394_MLP[0] = -8.16 finding across more seeds to confirm the main mechanistic claim."
  ]
